ildren\":\"195 countries\"}],\" and \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-5\",{\"children\":\"574 admin partitions\"}],\", at 10 m resolution. Each year is an\\nindependent global prediction, so the per-year count (~1.6 B) — not the both-years sum — is the\\nnumber of distinct fields in a year.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"children\":[\"Every vector polygon carries a \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"className\":\"inline-code\",\"children\":\"confidence\"}],\" score (0–100)\"]}],\", sampled at the polygon's\\nrepresentative point from the 500 m PRUE confidence layer and rescaled (\",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"className\":\"inline-code\",\"children\":\"raw / 0.578178 × 100\"}],\",\\nthe same scaling the \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"a-0\",{\"children\":\"FTW inference app\",\"data-accent-color\":\"\",\"href\":\"https://github.com/fieldsoftheworld/ftw-inference-app\",\"style\":\"$undefined\",\"ref\":null,\"className\":\"rt-Text rt-reset rt-Link rt-underline-always\"}],\" uses).\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-2\",{\"children\":[\"Model: \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"children\":\"PRUE\"}],\" (U-Net / EfficientNet-B7), trained on the CC-BY subset of the\\n\",[\"$\",\"a\",\"a-0\",{\"children\":\"Fields of The World benchmark\",\"data-accent-color\":\"\",\"href\":\"https://source.coop/kerner-lab/fields-of-the-world\",\"style\":\"$undefined\",\"ref\":null,\"className\":\"rt-Text rt-reset rt-Link rt-underline-always\"}],\" (24 countries).\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-3\",{\"children\":[\"A field here is a \",[\"$\",\"em\",\"em-0\",{\"children\":\"remote-sensing field unit\"}],\" (a connected component of predicted field-interior\\npixels), \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"children\":\"not\"}],\" a cadastral/legal parcel. This is not a land-tenure product.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-4\",{\"children\":[\"Outputs are \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"a-0\",{\"children\":\"fiboa\",\"data-accent-color\":\"\",\"href\":\"https://fiboa.org\"