3661 10.0438 2.54561 9.18863 3.00507 8.51227C3.10993 8.35791 3.27224 8.19244 3.69924 7.76544L4.31796 7.14672ZM9.62172 6.08558C9.81698 5.89032 9.81698 5.57373 9.62172 5.37847C9.42646 5.18321 9.10988 5.18321 8.91461 5.37847L5.37908 8.91401C5.18382 9.10927 5.18382 9.42585 5.37908 9.62111C5.57434 9.81637 5.89092 9.81637 6.08619 9.62111L9.62172 6.08558Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></a></h1>
