51227C3.10993 8.35791 3.27224 8.19244 3.69924 7.76544L4.31796 7.14672ZM9.62172 6.08558C9.81698 5.89032 9.81698 5.57373 9.62172 5.37847C9.42646 5.18321 9.10988 5.18321 8.91461 5.37847L5.37908 8.91401C5.18382 9.10927 5.18382 9.42585 5.37908 9.62111C5.57434 9.81637 5.89092 9.81637 6.08619 9.62111L9.62172 6.08558Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></a></h1>
<ul>
<li>The field-density <code class="inline-code">_filtered</code> variant&#x27;s exact threshold/method is pending author confirmation.</li>
<li>The confidence layer is conservative outside the FTW training distribution (e.g. smallholder
systems): real fields there may receive low confidence. Prefer the unfiltered density + continuous
confidence over a hard threshold in such regions.</li>
<li>Polygons are remote-sensing field units, not legal parcels; one parcel may map to many polygons or none.</li>
</ul>
