<p class="rt-Text rt-r-mb-3"><em>Published with <a data-accent-color="" href="https://portolan-sdi.org" class="rt-Text rt-reset rt-Link rt-underline-always">Portolan</a>.</em></p></div></div></div><table hidden><tr id="S:8"><td class="rt-TableCell">Zarr</td></tr></table><script>$RS("S:8","P:8")</script><table hidden><tr id="S:9"><td class="rt-TableCell">The raw PRUE softmax probabilities (non-field / field / field-boundary) the vectors are thresholded from. Multiscale (14 WGS84Quad levels), so it reads at any zoom.</td></tr></table><script>$RS("S:9","P:9")</script><div hidden id="S:a"><div class="rt-ScrollAreaViewportFocusRing"></div></div><script>$RS("S:a","P:a")</script><div hidden id="S:b"></div><script>$RS("S:b","P:b")</script><div hidden id="S:c"></div><script>$RS("S:c","P:c")</script><div hidden id="S:d"></div><script>$RS("S:d","P:d")</script><div hidden id="S:e"><template id="P:13"></template><template id="P:14"></template></div><script>$RS("S:e","P:e")</script><div hidden id="S:f"><template id="P:15"></template><template id="P:16"></template></div><script>$RS("S:f","P:f")</script><div hidden id="S:10"><template id="P:17"></template><template id="P:18"></template></div><script>$RS("S:10","P:10")</script><div hidden id="S:11"><template id="P:19"></template><template id="P:1a"></template></div><script>$RS("S:11","P:11")</script><div hidden id="S:12"><template id="P:1b"></template><template id="P:1c"></template></div><script>$RS("S:12","P:12")</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"a4:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"data-bright-theme\":\"github-dark\",\"data-bright-mode\":\"dark\",\"className\":\"$undefined\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#c9d1d9\",\"borderRadius\":\"4px\",\"overflow\":\"hidden\",\"margin\":\"1em 0\",\"--selection-background\":\"#264F78\",\"--line-number-color\":\"#6e7681\",\"--tab-border\":\"#30363d\",\"--tab-background\":\"#0d1117\",\"--tab-color\":\"#c9d1d9\",\"--inactive-tab-background\":\"#010409\",\"--inactive-tab-color\":\"#8b949e\",\"--tab-top-border\":